000400* quotient as stored in the GIVING item, times the divisor, at
000500* that item's scale (#29). Expected output recorded from IBM ANS
000600* COBOL on TK5.
000700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
000900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001000 01  Q     PIC 9V9(8).
